{"seq":2,"slug":"rate-limiting-algorithms","title":"限流算法对比：五大算法的权衡矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/fundamentals/rate-limiting-algorithms","wordCount":1250,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"限流算法对比-五大算法的权衡矩阵\">限流算法对比：五大算法的权衡矩阵</h1><p>限流算法的核心差异在于<strong>如何平衡精确度、内存开销和突发流量处理能力</strong>。每种算法都是不同工程约束下的最优解——没有绝对最佳的算法，只有最适合特定场景的选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>限流算法的本质是在<strong>精确度</strong>、<strong>内存开销</strong>和<strong>突发流量处理能力</strong>三者之间做权衡。五大主流算法覆盖了从「实现最简单」到「精确度最高」的完整光谱，每种算法都是不同工程约束下的最优解。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>精确度</th>\n<th>内存</th>\n<th>突发支持</th>\n<th>代表实现</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>固定窗口</td>\n<td>低（有边界突刺）</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>最简场景</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动日志</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>O(n)</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>安全审计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动计数器</td>\n<td>高（约95%）</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>Nginx、Redis</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>令牌桶</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>有</td>\n<td>公开 API</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏桶</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>保护后端</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"五大算法概览\">五大算法概览</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[固定窗口&lt;br/&gt;Fixed Window] --&gt; E{精确度}&#10;    B[滑动窗口日志&lt;br/&gt;Sliding Log] --&gt; E&#10;    C[滑动窗口计数器&lt;br/&gt;Sliding Counter] --&gt; E&#10;    D[令牌桶&lt;br/&gt;Token Bucket] --&gt; E&#10;    F[漏桶&lt;br/&gt;Leaky Bucket] --&gt; E&#10;    E -- 低 --&gt; A&#10;    E -- 最高 --&gt; B&#10;    E -- 高 --&gt; C&#10;    E -- 高 --&gt; D&#10;    E -- 高 --&gt; F\">graph LR\n    A[固定窗口&lt;br/&gt;Fixed Window] --&gt; E{精确度}\n    B[滑动窗口日志&lt;br/&gt;Sliding Log] --&gt; E\n    C[滑动窗口计数器&lt;br/&gt;Sliding Counter] --&gt; E\n    D[令牌桶&lt;br/&gt;Token Bucket] --&gt; E\n    F[漏桶&lt;br/&gt;Leaky Bucket] --&gt; E\n    E -- 低 --&gt; A\n    E -- 最高 --&gt; B\n    E -- 高 --&gt; C\n    E -- 高 --&gt; D\n    E -- 高 --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"固定窗口计数器\">固定窗口计数器</h2><p><strong>核心思想</strong>：将时间轴切割为等长区间，每个区间维护一个计数器。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"class FixedWindowRateLimiter {&#10;  constructor(limit, windowMs) {&#10;    this.limit = limit;&#10;    this.windowMs = windowMs;&#10;    this.counters = new Map(); // windowStart -&gt; count&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  isAllowed(key) {&#10;    const now = Date.now();&#10;    const windowStart = Math.floor(now / this.windowMs) * this.windowMs;&#10;    const windowKey = `${key}:${windowStart}`;&#10;&#10;    const count = this.counters.get(windowKey) ?? 0;&#10;    if (count &gt;= this.limit) return false;&#10;&#10;    this.counters.set(windowKey, count + 1);&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> FixedWindowRateLimiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">windowMs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> limit;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.windowMs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> windowMs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counters </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// windowStart -> count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  isAllowed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> windowStart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.windowMs) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.windowMs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> windowKey</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">key</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}:${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">windowStart</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> count</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counters.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(windowKey) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">??</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.limit) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.counters.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(windowKey, count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>突刺问题</strong>：窗口边界可通过 2x 速率。假设 limit=100，窗口=60s：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>59s 时：发送 100 个请求（当前窗口用满）</li>\n<li>61s 时：再发送 100 个请求（新窗口开始，计数清零）</li>\n<li>两秒内共处理 200 个请求</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>适用场景</strong>：对精确度要求不高、计数实现最简单的场景（如内部工具、非安全敏感接口）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滑动窗口日志\">滑动窗口日志</h2><p><strong>核心思想</strong>：存储每个请求的精确时间戳，计数时只统计滑动窗口内的记录。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"class SlidingLogRateLimiter {&#10;  constructor(limit, windowMs) {&#10;    this.limit = limit;&#10;    this.windowMs = windowMs;&#10;    this.logs = new Map(); // key -&gt; sorted timestamps&#10;  }&#10;&#10;  isAllowed(key) {&#10;    const now = Date.now();&#10;    const windowStart = now - this.windowMs;&#10;&#10;    if (!this.logs.has(key)) this.logs.set(key, []);&#10;    const log = this.logs.get(key);&#10;&#10;    // 清理过期记录（O(n) 可用二分搜索优化）&#10;    const validIdx = log.findIndex((t) =&gt; t &gt; windowStart);&#10;    if (validIdx &gt; 0) log.splice(0, validIdx);&#10;&#10;    if (log.length &gt;= this.limit) return false;&#10;&#10;    log.push(now);&#10;    return true;&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> SlidingLogRateLimiter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  constructor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">limit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">windowMs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.limit </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> limit;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.windowMs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> windowMs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.logs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Map</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// key -> sorted timestamps</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">  isAllowed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> windowStart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.windowMs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.logs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">has</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key)) </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.logs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">set</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, []);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> log</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.logs.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 清理过期记录（O(n) 可用二分搜索优化）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> validIdx</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findIndex</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">((</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> t </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> windowStart);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (validIdx </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">splice</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, validIdx);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (log.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.limit) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    log.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">push</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(now);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>优势</strong>：精确计数，无突刺问题。\n<strong>劣势</strong>：内存开销与请求数成正比。若 limit=10000，每个用户需存储最多 10000 条时间戳记录。</p>\n<h2 id=\"滑动窗口计数器\">滑动窗口计数器</h2><p><strong>核心思想</strong>：用两个固定窗口的计数器，通过加权估算当前滑动窗口内的请求数，是精确度和内存开销之间的工程折中。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"isAllowed(key) {&#10;  const now = Date.now();&#10;  const windowStart = Math.floor(now / this.windowMs) * this.windowMs;&#10;  const prevWindowStart = windowStart - this.windowMs;&#10;&#10;  const currentCount = this.getCount(key, windowStart);&#10;  const prevCount = this.getCount(key, prevWindowStart);&#10;&#10;  // 当前时间在当前窗口内的进度比例&#10;  const progress = (now - windowStart) / this.windowMs;&#10;  // 加权估算：上一窗口的剩余部分 + 当前窗口已有请求&#10;  const estimated = prevCount * (1 - progress) + currentCount;&#10;&#10;  if (estimated &gt;= this.limit) return false;&#10;  this.increment(key, windowStart);&#10;  return true;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">isAllowed</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Date.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> windowStart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">floor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.windowMs) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.windowMs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prevWindowStart</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> windowStart </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.windowMs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> currentCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, windowStart);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prevCount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getCount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, prevWindowStart);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 当前时间在当前窗口内的进度比例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> progress</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (now </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> windowStart) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.windowMs;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 加权估算：上一窗口的剩余部分 + 当前窗口已有请求</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> estimated</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> prevCount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> -</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> progress) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> currentCount;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (estimated </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.limit) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">increment</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(key, windowStart);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是 Nginx 和 Redis-cell 的实现策略——用 O(1) 的空间近似实现了滑动窗口的精确度（误差在窗口边界处约 5%）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"令牌桶\">令牌桶</h2><p><strong>核心思想</strong>：桶中以固定速率添加令牌，每个请求消耗一个令牌。桶有容量上限，允许一定程度的突发请求。</p>\n<p>见本章 <a href=\"token-bucket-leaky-bucket\">令牌桶与漏桶</a> 的深度实现。</p>\n<p><strong>关键特性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>允许突发：桶满时积累令牌，短时间内可消耗全部（突发容量 = 桶容量）</li>\n<li>平均速率受填充速率控制</li>\n<li>适合需要弹性处理突发流量的场景</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"漏桶\">漏桶</h2><p><strong>核心思想</strong>：请求以任意速率流入，以固定速率流出（处理）。超出桶容量的请求直接丢弃或排队等待。</p>\n<p>见本章 <a href=\"token-bucket-leaky-bucket\">令牌桶与漏桶</a> 的深度实现。</p>\n<p><strong>关键特性</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>严格平滑输出速率，不允许突发</li>\n<li>保护后端服务免受流量尖峰冲击</li>\n<li>适合需要稳定输出速率的场景（如支付接口）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"算法选型决策矩阵\">算法选型决策矩阵</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>固定窗口</th>\n<th>滑动日志</th>\n<th>滑动计数器</th>\n<th>令牌桶</th>\n<th>漏桶</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>精确度</td>\n<td>低（边界突刺）</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>高（~5%误差）</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存开销</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(n·请求数)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n<td>O(1)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>突发支持</td>\n<td>无（有边界突刺）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>有（桶容量）</td>\n<td>无</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实现复杂度</td>\n<td>最简单</td>\n<td>简单</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分布式友好</td>\n<td>原子递增即可</td>\n<td>需有序集合</td>\n<td>需原子操作</td>\n<td>需 CAS</td>\n<td>需队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型使用</td>\n<td>内部工具</td>\n<td>安全审计</td>\n<td>Nginx/Redis</td>\n<td>公开 API</td>\n<td>支付/消息队列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"选型指南\">选型指南</h2><p><strong>优先选令牌桶</strong>，当满足以下条件：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要允许短时突发（用户快速连续操作）</li>\n<li>服务有一定弹性，能处理短暂的高峰</li>\n<li>大多数公开 API 的标准选择</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选漏桶</strong>，当：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>保护下游服务（如消息队列消费者、支付处理器）</li>\n<li>需要严格的稳定输出速率</li>\n<li>下游对流量抖动敏感</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>选滑动窗口计数器</strong>，当：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>在令牌桶精确度和固定窗口简单性之间取折中</li>\n<li>使用 Redis 实现，Nginx 原生支持此模式</li>\n<li>对内存有约束，同时要求较高精确度</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>避免滑动日志</strong>，除非：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要精确的请求审计</li>\n<li>请求量极小（如管理员操作日志）</li>\n<li>内存不是瓶颈</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>没有完美算法：固定窗口最省内存但有突刺；滑动日志最精确但内存重；滑动窗口计数器是工程折中</li>\n<li>令牌桶允许突发，适合公开 API；漏桶平滑输出，适合保护后端</li>\n<li>分布式场景下，所有算法都需要考虑原子性——固定窗口用原子递增最容易实现</li>\n<li>选型时优先考虑你的核心约束：精确度、内存、突发需求，再查矩阵</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote>\n<p>兄弟文档：<a href=\"token-bucket-leaky-bucket\">令牌桶与漏桶</a> 深入两种最重要算法的完整实现；<a href=\"rate-limiting-core-concepts\">限流核心概念</a> 回顾计数维度与响应语义。</p>\n</blockquote>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"限流算法对比：五大算法的权衡矩阵","id":"限流算法对比-五大算法的权衡矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"五大算法概览","id":"五大算法概览"},{"level":2,"text":"固定窗口计数器","id":"固定窗口计数器"},{"level":2,"text":"滑动窗口日志","id":"滑动窗口日志"},{"level":2,"text":"滑动窗口计数器","id":"滑动窗口计数器"},{"level":2,"text":"令牌桶","id":"令牌桶"},{"level":2,"text":"漏桶","id":"漏桶"},{"level":2,"text":"算法选型决策矩阵","id":"算法选型决策矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"选型指南","id":"选型指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"限流核心概念：计数维度、时间窗口与响应语义","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/fundamentals/rate-limiting-core-concepts"},"next":{"title":"令牌桶与漏桶：两种经典算法的深度实现","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/api-rate-limiting-patterns/fundamentals/token-bucket-leaky-bucket"}}